3. Detection throughput
==============================================================================
cpu        1255.8 texts/s  (0.8 ms per 250-token text)
cuda:0     1257.2 texts/s  (0.8 ms per 250-token text)
Detection is a hash plus a mean: it needs the tokenizer, not the model,
and runs fast enough on CPU that a detection service needs no GPU.
